logement . électricité . réseau . consommation via factures:
  unité: $/month

logement . électricité . réseau . coût du kWh:
  formule: 0.173
  unité: $/kWh
  note: |
    This formula allows us to switch from $/month to kWh/year.

    The figure includes a subscription cost, and therefore represents an average. It is not the marginal price per kWh. It includes taxes.

    Figure taken from <a href="https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index.php?title=Electricity_price_statistics">Eurostat, household, first half 2023</a>.

